@startuml activity-sync-user-accounts
' Sync user accounts: Clerk sends an account event (webhook) and the shop
' updates its own copy of the user. Events are checked and handled once.

title Sync user accounts

|Clerk|
|Coffee Shop System|

|Clerk|
start
:Send an account event\n(created, updated or deleted);
|Coffee Shop System|
:Check the event signature;
if (Valid?) then ([no])
  :Reject the event;
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
if (Already handled?) then ([yes])
  :Ignore the event;
  stop
else ([no])
endif
switch (Event type?)
case ([created])
  :Create the user\n(role USER);
  :Record the role sync\n(sent to Clerk later);
case ([updated])
  :Update the user's copy;
case ([deleted])
  :Mark the user deleted;
endswitch
stop

@enduml
